<title>FRANCE: France holds 96 grain crop forecast at 61.88 mln T.</title>
<headline>France holds 96 grain crop forecast at 61.88 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's farm ministry said on Thursday it kept its estimate for the 1996 grain crop unchanged from the previous month at 61.88 million tonnes.</p>
<p>This would compare with a 1995 grain harvest of 53.55 million tonnes.</p>
<p>In its December report, the ministry's statistics office SCEES maintained its estimates for the 1996 soft wheat, barley and maize crops.</p>
<p>It put the soft wheat crop at 34.63 million tonnes against 29.85 million produced in 1995.</p>
<p>The barley crop was projected to rise to 9.45 million tonnes from 7.69 million and the maize crop to 13.97 million from 12.74 million.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
